Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:07.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（韦尔斯本 沃里克 利明顿）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.16,0:00:10.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.16,0:00:10.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我太激动了 - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.76,0:00:13.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know, you've been bouncing around like a three-year-old
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.76,0:00:14.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你这一个月 为这事兴奋得像个三岁小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.84,0:00:14.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}for a month over this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.84,0:00:16.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Have you ever been? - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.84,0:00:16.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你去过吗？ - 没有！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:17.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, it's so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:17.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.52,0:00:19.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（北伯明翰）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.76,0:00:25.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Did you really have your hair cut this morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.76,0:00:25.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你今天早上真的剪头发了？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.16,0:00:26.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Seven o'clock this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.16,0:00:26.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}早上七点剪的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.76,0:00:28.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}To go to an agricultural machinery show?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.76,0:00:28.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就为了去一个农业机械展？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.96,0:00:30.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well not necessarily, I was getting my hair cut anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.96,0:00:30.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那倒不是 反正我也该剪头发了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.84,0:00:32.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It was falling every six weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.84,0:00:32.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 每六周剪一次 - 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.72,0:00:34.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But then I thought, if I'm going,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.72,0:00:34.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我又想：“既然要去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.16,0:00:36.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I may as well book it on the Wednesday in the morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.16,0:00:36.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那我不如约在周三早上 把头发弄一下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.76,0:00:38.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}have my hair done and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.76,0:00:38.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 然后再去” - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.68,0:00:43.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've been to probably fifty motor shows in my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.68,0:00:43.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你起得早 整个人精神焕发… - 我这辈子大概看过五十场车展
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.20,0:00:45.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}in Detroit, Geneva, Tokyo,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.20,0:00:45.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 在底特律、日内瓦、东京… - 是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.84,0:00:48.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}London, Birmingham,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.84,0:00:48.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…伦敦、伯明翰都是这样 我从没剪了头发再去看
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.16,0:00:51.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- and I've never had my hair cut to go. - That's why you always look scruffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.16,0:00:51.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就是为什么你总是一副邋遢相
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.68,0:00:55.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Lisa's gonna be furious. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.68,0:00:55.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 顺便说一句 丽莎会气疯的 - 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.00,0:00:56.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, 'cause you've got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.00,0:00:56.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为你开了这车？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.56,0:01:01.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've nicked her car. She said last night: "I've got to go to London tomorrow."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.56,0:00:59.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我偷开了她的车 她昨晚还说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.24,0:01:01.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“我明天要去伦敦”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.16,0:01:02.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What's she driving then? - So I said:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.16,0:01:02.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 她开什么车？ - 我就问
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.84,0:01:05.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Are you going on the train or driving?" She said: "Well, no, I'm gonna drive."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.84,0:01:05.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“你坐火车还是开车？” 她说：“我开车去”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.60,0:01:08.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And I was drawing breath to say: "I need your car to go to Birmingham."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.60,0:01:08.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我刚要开口说 “我想用你的车去伯明翰”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.76,0:01:09.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You didn't have it in you to say, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.76,0:01:09.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你没好意思说？ - 我就说了句：“好的”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.84,0:01:12.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I just went, "Oh, OK." - And then you took her car!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.84,0:01:12.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 然后你就把她的车开走了！ - 不 我们趁她还没起床就出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.44,0:01:14.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, we left before she was up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.44,0:01:16.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 她会来…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.44,0:01:16.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So she's going to come out...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.96,0:01:21.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}剧名：《克拉克森的农场》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.60,0:01:25.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}《第三十五集 出行》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.92,0:01:28.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（过去 现在 未来）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.56,0:01:37.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Every January for a few days,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.56,0:01:37.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}每年一月 有那么几天 全国各地的田地里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.88,0:01:43.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}fields right across the country have no farmers in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.88,0:01:43.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}都看不到农民的身影 因为每年这个时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.36,0:01:47.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because this is the time of year when they go to Birmingham for LAMMA,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.36,0:01:45.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（伯明翰 国展中心）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.16,0:01:48.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…他们都会去伯明翰 参加LAMMA…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.24,0:01:51.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the annual farm machinery show.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.24,0:01:49.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（LAMMA参展商）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.88,0:01:51.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…年度农业机械展
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:55.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at the amount of pickup trucks going to the NEC.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:55.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看有多少皮卡开进国家展览中心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.92,0:02:01.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now this is a proper... Look at this chap here, he's got it all worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.92,0:02:01.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这才是正经的…你看这个家伙 安排得明明白白
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.04,0:02:03.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No styling happened with that roof on his pickup.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.04,0:02:03.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他的皮卡的车顶一点造型都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.68,0:02:06.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, but it's designed to fit in a lot of dead sheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.68,0:02:06.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没有 但它的设计 是为了能装下很多死羊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.80,0:02:08.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.80,0:02:08.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.48,0:02:13.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Once inside the vast halls,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.48,0:02:13.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一走进巨大的展厅
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.88,0:02:18.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb became as excited as I used to be at motor shows...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.88,0:02:18.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布就变得兴奋起来 就像我八岁时
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.00,0:02:19.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}when I was eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.00,0:02:19.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在车展上那样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.12,0:02:22.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, look at the CR9!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.12,0:02:22.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看那个CR9！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.24,0:02:24.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's where they had the CR11 last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.24,0:02:26.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}去年那个位置放的是CR11 这是它的小号版本
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.52,0:02:26.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is a smaller version of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.52,0:02:30.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can't work out why they've got... This as a CR9-90.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.52,0:02:30.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我搞不懂为什么他们有…这是CR9.90
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.56,0:02:32.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know, it says that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.56,0:02:32.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 上面写着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.76,0:02:34.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's nice, isn't it? I like the colour. Has it got black rims?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.76,0:02:34.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不错 是吧？我喜欢这颜色 它有黑色轮毂？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.84,0:02:36.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yes. - Oh, look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.84,0:02:36.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 有 - 你看那个！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.04,0:02:38.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And it's got the blue round the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.04,0:02:38.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 而且外面一圈是蓝色的 挺酷的 - 还有那蓝色
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.00,0:02:40.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's cool that, hey? That's me. That's a bit of me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.00,0:02:40.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这正合我意 这有点对我的胃口
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.80,0:02:42.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What is? - That.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.80,0:02:42.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 什么？ - 那个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.96,0:02:45.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, look at it: blinged up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.96,0:02:45.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 花里胡哨的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.72,0:02:46.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I, meanwhile,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.72,0:02:46.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}与此同时 我感觉就像我妹妹八岁时
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.96,0:02:51.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}felt like my sister used to feel at motor shows when she was eight:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.96,0:02:51.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在车展上的感觉一样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.08,0:02:54.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}completely baffled by everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.08,0:02:54.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对一切都完全摸不着头脑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.60,0:02:56.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.60,0:02:56.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.68,0:03:01.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is a great start.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.68,0:03:01.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这个开头真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.40,0:03:06.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A mower.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.40,0:03:06.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}割草机
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.48,0:03:08.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Nearly. It's a mulcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.48,0:03:08.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}差不多 是土壤覆盖机
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.04,0:03:09.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh, is it? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.04,0:03:09.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是吗？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.20,0:03:10.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.20,0:03:10.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.68,0:03:13.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm... Muck spreader?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.68,0:03:13.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}撒肥机？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.92,0:03:15.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No. That's a straw blower.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.92,0:03:15.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是什么？ - 不对 是秸秆抛撒机
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.60,0:03:16.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's that there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.60,0:03:16.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那边那个是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.64,0:03:19.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Pile driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.64,0:03:19.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}打桩机
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.04,0:03:20.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Log splitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.04,0:03:20.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}劈木机
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.32,0:03:22.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's that one over there then?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.32,0:03:22.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那那边那个呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.04,0:03:23.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a tedder.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.04,0:03:23.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是干草翻晒机 - 是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.64,0:03:25.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It's a what? - It's a tedder.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.64,0:03:25.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}干草翻晒机
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.64,0:03:27.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you mow your grass, you come through with a tedder, flips it back over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.64,0:03:27.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你割完草 用翻晒机过一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.92,0:03:30.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You see what I mean? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.92,0:03:30.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把草翻过来 你明白我的意思吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.04,0:03:31.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.04,0:03:32.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb, how are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.04,0:03:32.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 卡莱布 你好吗？ - 嗨 你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.64,0:03:34.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Are you well? - Yeah, not bad, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.64,0:03:34.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 还不错 老兄 - 很高兴见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.92,0:03:36.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Where is the old, er... - There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.92,0:03:36.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那个老家伙在… - 他在那儿呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.76,0:03:38.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ah, you old sort! How're you diddling?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.76,0:03:38.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你这个老东西！你好吗？ - 你好吗？还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.56,0:03:40.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Are you all right? - Yeah, not too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.56,0:03:40.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 还不错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.48,0:03:45.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb, just endlessly stopped by big-boned men with stout shoes on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.48,0:03:45.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布不停地被那些穿着厚底鞋的 大块头男人拦下来聊天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.52,0:03:48.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Pauses only to tell me things that make no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.52,0:03:48.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}只有在跟我说 一些我听不懂的事情时才会停一下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.80,0:03:55.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Later in the morning, I lost my guide...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.80,0:03:55.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}上午晚些时候 我的向导不见了…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.60,0:03:57.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's nice to be able to give people that opportunity...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.60,0:03:57.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}能有这样的机会真好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.56,0:04:01.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}...because he'd been booked to take part in some sort of
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.56,0:04:03.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…因为他被安排去参加 一个类似乡村版TED演讲的活动
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.12,0:04:03.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}rural TED talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.32,0:04:05.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello, everybody. I'm Kaleb.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.32,0:04:07.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}大家好 我是卡莱布 大家可能 通过《克拉克森的农场》认识我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.28,0:04:07.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Probably best known as I'm on "Clarkson's Farm".
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.44,0:04:10.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But of course I've got my own theatre tour that I did beginning of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.44,0:04:10.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过当然 今年年初
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.04,0:04:12.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm, also got three books out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.04,0:04:12.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我也有自己的巡回剧场秀 还出了三本书
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.56,0:04:14.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As he humbly introduced himself...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.56,0:04:16.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在他“谦虚”地介绍自己时
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.84,0:04:15.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Stuff on social media...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.00,0:04:20.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}...I walked around in a state of complete confusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.00,0:04:20.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我四处走动 完全处于一种迷茫的状态
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.40,0:04:23.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.40,0:04:23.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.84,0:04:26.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.84,0:04:26.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那个是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.80,0:04:29.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.80,0:04:29.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那个呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.76,0:04:32.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh look, a lunar rover.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.76,0:04:32.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看 一辆月球车
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.68,0:04:36.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}See, this is what it's like when you walk round without Kaleb.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.68,0:04:36.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就是没有卡莱布 陪着走的感觉 就像在…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.60,0:04:39.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's like being in a... I don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.60,0:04:39.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不知道 就像在柬埔寨的市场里 你看着所有的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:42.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}a market in Cambodia where you just look at all the things and think:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:47.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}心想：“那是鱼吗？ 那是植物吗？我不知道”
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.96,0:04:47.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Oh, is that a fish? Is it a plant? I dunno."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.72,0:04:54.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Eventually, I arrived in a hall full of futuristic high-tech equipment,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.72,0:04:53.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}最终 我来到了一个 满是未来感高科技设备的展厅…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.68,0:04:54.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（我们锄草 你种植）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.56,0:05:00.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}where I expected to be even more baffled.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.56,0:04:58.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（ROBOCROP 精准导航系统）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.32,0:05:00.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…我本以为在这里会更摸不着头脑
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.76,0:05:04.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But, once the salesman got his teeth into me,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.76,0:05:04.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但一旦销售员开始给我详细讲解
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.88,0:05:08.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I became quite intrigued.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.88,0:05:08.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我就变得相当感兴趣了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.32,0:05:10.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Have you ever seen something like this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.32,0:05:10.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你以前见过这样的东西吗？ - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.08,0:05:12.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No. Er, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.08,0:05:12.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.68,0:05:14.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a seeding and weeding machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.68,0:05:14.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是一台播种和除草一体机
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.52,0:05:18.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's an autonomous vehicle, electrical driven. It's, er, powered...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.52,0:05:18.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是一台自动驾驶的电动机器 它的动力…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.36,0:05:20.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I'm guessing solar. - Powered by the solar, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.36,0:05:20.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我猜是太阳能 - 对 靠太阳能驱动
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.64,0:05:22.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}In Denmark?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.64,0:05:23.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 在丹麦？太阳能？ - 太阳能？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.20,0:05:23.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Solar. - Solar?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.60,0:05:26.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What, on June 7th in 1981 there was a sunny day there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.60,0:05:26.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 太阳能 - 怎么 1981年6月7日那天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.36,0:05:28.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.36,0:05:28.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 丹麦出太阳了？ - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.36,0:05:30.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But what if there's no sunshine? Which does happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.36,0:05:30.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但如果没太阳呢？ 这种情况确实会发生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.84,0:05:32.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It does actually run twenty-four seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.84,0:05:32.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它实际上可以全天候运行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.88,0:05:36.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It has a battery pack in the back, so it's running in the night too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.88,0:05:36.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}后面有一个电池组 所以晚上也能工作
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.24,0:05:38.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So then, how's the weeding and seeding...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.24,0:05:38.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那么 除草和播种是怎么… - 基本上 这既是一台播种机
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.36,0:05:40.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Basically, this is a seeding machine,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.36,0:05:40.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（农耕机器人）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.64,0:05:44.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it's a weeding machine, and it's all done by GPS.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.64,0:05:44.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}也是除草机 所有这些都通过GPS完成
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.00,0:05:45.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}God, how accurate is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.00,0:05:45.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪 精度有多高？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.88,0:05:47.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Accuracy between 8 and 10 millimetres.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.88,0:05:47.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}精度在8到10毫米之间
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.92,0:05:50.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh my word. What's the phallus?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.92,0:05:48.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.84,0:05:50.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那个棒状物是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.92,0:05:54.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This one? That's the GSM antenna.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.92,0:05:54.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这个吗？GSM天线 - 那是卫星导航吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.04,0:05:56.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So what's that then? - That's the GPS antenna.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.04,0:05:56.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那那个是什么？ - 那是GPS天线
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.68,0:05:59.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the last one here, that is the rain gauge.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.68,0:05:59.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}最后这个 是雨量计
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.48,0:06:02.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So if it suddenly starts raining,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.48,0:06:02.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 如果突然开始下雨
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.52,0:06:04.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}let's say one millimetre of rain, it will just stop the operation
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.52,0:06:04.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}比如说一毫米的雨量
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.40,0:06:08.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to avoid damaging the crops.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.40,0:06:08.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它就会停止作业 以免损坏农作物
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.08,0:06:11.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then you of course get a message back saying, OK, it's stopped due to the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.08,0:06:11.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后你当然会收到一条消息 说：“好的 因下雨停止作业”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.76,0:06:14.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh, you can talk to it? - Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.76,0:06:14.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你可以跟它说话？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.04,0:06:18.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you're looking on your phone or your tablet, on an app,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.04,0:06:18.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 你在手机或平板电脑上 通过一个应用程序查看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.16,0:06:21.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}then you can see, you know, if it's running out of seed it will stop
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.16,0:06:21.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果种子快用完了 它会停下来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.12,0:06:24.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and send a message back: "Hey, Jeremy, I'm out of seeds."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.12,0:06:24.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}发回一条消息 “嘿 杰里米 我没种子了”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.76,0:06:28.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So my recommendation is to choose the high-value crop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.76,0:06:28.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 我的建议是选择高价值的作物
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.60,0:06:31.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It could be onion or beets or red beets or...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.60,0:06:31.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 可以是洋葱、甜菜或者红甜菜… - 洋葱？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.76,0:06:34.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Onions? Are onions high value?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.76,0:06:34.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 洋葱算高价值作物吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.16,0:06:35.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I would say so, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.16,0:06:35.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得算
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.52,0:06:37.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you filled those up with onions...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.52,0:06:37.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 如果你给这些机器装满洋葱… - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.40,0:06:38.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.40,0:06:40.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…它在用完之前能耕多大一块地？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.36,0:06:40.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How big a field would it do before it ran out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.76,0:06:43.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You can seed at least five hectares, that's no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.76,0:06:43.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它至少可以播种五公顷 完全没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.32,0:06:45.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So that's what? Twelve acres.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.32,0:06:45.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是多少？十二英亩？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.56,0:06:47.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're doing five hectares a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.56,0:06:47.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们一天能耕五公顷
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.76,0:06:49.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.76,0:06:49.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.48,0:06:52.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Meanwhile, over in the TED talk,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.48,0:06:52.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}与此同时 在TED演讲那边 卡莱布完全进入了人生导师大师模式
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.28,0:06:56.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb was in full life-coach-guru mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.28,0:06:59.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}梦想不会自己实现 除非你行动起来 我始终把这句话记在心里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.60,0:06:59.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Dreams don't work unless you do. I take that with me all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.84,0:07:02.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And no matter what you do, if you keep working hard, and again,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.84,0:07:02.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你能做到的 无论你做什么 只要你努力…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.40,0:07:05.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}dreams don't work, unless you can make that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.40,0:07:05.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}再说一次 梦想不会自己实现… 你可以让它成真
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.40,0:07:07.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I think actually believe in yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.40,0:07:07.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 我认为 要相信自己 从一开始就对自己说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.08,0:07:09.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and actually just go "Yeah, you are good enough" straight away from the get-go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.08,0:07:11.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“对 你足够优秀” 永远不要觉得自己不行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.76,0:07:11.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Don't ever believe that you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.32,0:07:12.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And if you're not, it's fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.32,0:07:15.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果不行 那也没关系 那只能说明你不适合做那事 所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.36,0:07:15.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you're just not meant to be doing that certain thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.16,0:07:18.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Back in the future, having been bewitched by a machine
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.16,0:07:18.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}回到未来这边
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.32,0:07:23.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that could plant crops without the need for a tractor,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.32,0:07:23.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在被一台无需拖拉机 就能种植农作物的机器迷住之后
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.92,0:07:28.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'd now found a tractor that had no need for a driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.92,0:07:28.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我现在又发现了 一台不需要驾驶员的拖拉机
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.24,0:07:31.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So this is probably the first in the market
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.24,0:07:33.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这大概是市场上第一款全自动拖拉机
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.48,0:07:33.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that is a fully autonomous tractor
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.56,0:07:36.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that we can let go night and day unattended.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.56,0:07:36.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们可以让它日夜不停地 自行作业 无需看管
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.40,0:07:38.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So it just runs? - Runs night and day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.40,0:07:38.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 所以 它就自己运行… - 日夜不停地运行 设置好 去睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.64,0:07:42.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Set it off, go to bed, get up in the morning, job done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.64,0:07:42.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}早上起来 活儿就干完了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.16,0:07:44.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You set it up to... drill?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.16,0:07:44.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你设置它来播种？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.84,0:07:46.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, cultivate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.84,0:07:47.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 也用来耕地 用的是标准后悬挂
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.72,0:07:47.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Standard rear linkage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.92,0:07:49.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you've got all your existing implements on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.92,0:07:49.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以你现有的农具都能挂上去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.96,0:07:52.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Standard hydraulics. Front linkage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.96,0:07:52.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}标准液压系统 前悬挂
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.68,0:07:54.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Just everything that you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.68,0:07:54.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你需要的一切它都有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.60,0:07:56.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How fast will this one go along?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.60,0:07:58.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它能跑多快？ 就跟普通拖拉机的速度一样吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.72,0:07:58.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is it just like a normal tractor speed?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.72,0:08:01.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, so nought to 12.6 km/h.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.72,0:08:01.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 从零到12.6公里每小时
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.52,0:08:04.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}OK. So fast enough to do normal farming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.52,0:08:06.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 那对于常规农活来说够快了 - 绝对够 常规作业 对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.60,0:08:06.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Absolutely, normal work, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.16,0:08:08.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So it can do normal farming. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.16,0:08:08.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 所以 它能干常规的农活 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.04,0:08:09.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Without Kaleb.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.04,0:08:09.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不需要卡莱布
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.28,0:08:13.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A tractor with no aggravation. Imagine that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.28,0:08:13.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一台不会让你头疼的拖拉机 想象一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.52,0:08:14.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, no Kaleb?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.52,0:08:14.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不用卡莱布？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.80,0:08:17.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No Kaleb. Just imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.80,0:08:17.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不用卡莱布 想象一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.08,0:08:25.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}My mind was now racing with all sorts of new ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.08,0:08:25.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的脑海里现在充满了各种新想法…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.76,0:08:31.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Which, the following day, I couldn't wait to share with Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.76,0:08:31.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第二天 我迫不及待地想和查理分享
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.76,0:08:35.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Farming
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.76,0:08:37.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}年复一年 农活儿一成不变
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.32,0:08:37.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}does what it does year in and year out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.96,0:08:39.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.96,0:08:39.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.20,0:08:41.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We are reaching a point
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.20,0:08:44.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然而到了现在 这已经行不通了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:43.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}where that's just not working anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.08,0:08:45.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The climate's changing
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.08,0:08:47.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}气候在变化 政府还蠢得要命
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.80,0:08:47.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and we have a truly idiotic government.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.64,0:08:50.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, it's like beating your head against a wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.64,0:08:50.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以现在就像拿头撞墙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.28,0:08:53.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Idiotic government and it never stops raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.28,0:08:53.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}政府蠢得要命 雨还下个不停
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.32,0:08:55.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's no point doing what you do year in, year out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.32,0:08:55.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 年复一年地那么干… - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.80,0:08:57.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The definition of idiocy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.80,0:08:57.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…已经没意义了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.48,0:09:00.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}is doing the same thing over and over again
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.48,0:09:00.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}愚蠢的定义就是 一遍又一遍地做同一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.60,0:09:02.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- and expecting a different result. - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.60,0:09:02.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 却期望得到不同的结果 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.72,0:09:05.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've now reached a point where farmers, I think, have to say:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.72,0:09:05.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们觉得 现在农民们必须得说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.88,0:09:07.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"We have to do this differently."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.88,0:09:08.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-“我们得换个法子干了” - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.92,0:09:08.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah. - So...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.84,0:09:10.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.84,0:09:10.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.80,0:09:16.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- An Agbot? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.80,0:09:16.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 一台农业机器人？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.56,0:09:19.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're gonna have a driverless tractor?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.56,0:09:19.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你要买一台无人驾驶拖拉机？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.88,0:09:24.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm not a very good tractor driver,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.88,0:09:24.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不是一个很好的拖拉机驾驶员
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.08,0:09:26.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've come to understand that after five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.08,0:09:26.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}过了五年 我终于明白了这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:28.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can't plough, I can't cultivate, I can't drill,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:28.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不会犁地 不会耕地
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.80,0:09:31.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can't attach anything to it still.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.80,0:09:31.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不会播种 到现在连挂农具都不会
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.80,0:09:34.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Once that thing's plodding around
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.80,0:09:34.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一旦那东西在地里慢慢转悠 完成耕地或者播种
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.76,0:09:38.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}doing cultivating or drilling or whatever job you've given it...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.76,0:09:39.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 或者你交给它的任何任务… - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.24,0:09:39.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.16,0:09:41.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You can be getting on with something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.16,0:09:41.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…你就能腾出手干别的了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.48,0:09:44.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And it doesn't make mistakes. Unlike me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.48,0:09:44.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且它不会犯错 不像我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.44,0:09:47.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm... OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.44,0:09:50.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 那你是不是也需要 在地里标出障碍物的位置？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.20,0:09:50.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You have to mark out obstacles in the field as well, presumably?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.20,0:09:52.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We haven't really got any obstacles in our fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.20,0:09:52.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们的地里基本上没什么障碍物
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.64,0:09:56.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We don't have trees. We've got one telegraph pole that I hit in...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.64,0:09:56.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们没有树 我们有一根电线杆 我撞上去过…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.08,0:09:58.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- There are five in that field. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.08,0:09:58.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那块地里有五根 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.52,0:10:01.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Will it lift everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.52,0:10:03.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它能举起所有东西吗？ 它看起来挺小巧的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.84,0:10:02.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It looks quite compact.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.00,0:10:06.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, they must have written what its lifting capabilities are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.00,0:10:06.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}肯定有说明 他们肯定 写了它的举升能力是多少
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.60,0:10:08.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Did you not ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.60,0:10:08.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你没问吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.20,0:10:10.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No. I just thought it looked really cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.20,0:10:10.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没有 我就是看着觉得挺酷的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.88,0:10:14.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And, that brings me onto...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.88,0:10:14.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就引出了我接下来要说的 播种除草机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.36,0:10:17.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}seeding and weeding robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.36,0:10:17.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（农耕机器人 FD20）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.08,0:10:21.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But that's gonna do the planting?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.08,0:10:21.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但是它…那能用来播种？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.64,0:10:24.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ah, not of the onions and beetroot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.64,0:10:24.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不是种洋葱和甜菜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.20,0:10:26.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We don't grow onions and beetroot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.20,0:10:26.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们不种洋葱和甜菜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.44,0:10:30.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- We're growing onions and beetroot? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.44,0:10:30.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们要种洋葱和甜菜了？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.76,0:10:34.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why onions and beetroot?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.76,0:10:34.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为什么是洋葱和甜菜？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.08,0:10:36.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause that's what this can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.08,0:10:36.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为这机器能种
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.44,0:10:38.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, the tech does it, so we're growing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.44,0:10:38.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 因为技术能做到 所以我们就要种？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.64,0:10:40.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I wanna see if it does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.64,0:10:40.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我想看看它是不是真能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.12,0:10:51.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}While Charlie went off to source this new kit,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.12,0:10:51.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在查理去采购这些新设备的同时
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.40,0:10:54.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I decided to go to the Netherlands
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.40,0:10:54.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我决定去荷兰
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.92,0:10:58.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to look at the high-tech farming that they're doing over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.92,0:10:58.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看他们那边正在搞的高科技农业
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.72,0:11:01.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（温德尔伯里交汇处）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.00,0:11:05.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}At first, this felt odd,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.00,0:11:05.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}起初 这感觉很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.36,0:11:08.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because normally, when I'm on a road trip with a film crew,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.36,0:11:08.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为通常我和摄制组一起公路旅行时
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.60,0:11:11.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm accompanied by Hammond and May,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.60,0:11:14.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}身边会有哈蒙德和梅作伴 他们也是经验丰富的环球旅行家
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.40,0:11:14.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}who are also seasoned globetrotters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.52,0:11:19.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This time, though, my companion wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.52,0:11:19.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过这一次 我的旅伴换人了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.76,0:11:33.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is the air like the same here, in France?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.76,0:11:33.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}法国的空气和英国一样吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.68,0:11:38.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is it different? Do you smell different, like...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.68,0:11:38.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是不是不一样？ 闻起来是不是不一样 比如…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.04,0:11:39.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you know what I mean? Like, is it dense? Is it...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.04,0:11:40.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你明白我的意思吗？ 更稠密吗？不一样吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.76,0:11:40.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is it different?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.80,0:11:42.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, it's not. It's the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.80,0:11:42.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 不是的 是一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.20,0:11:45.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's gonna feel weird leaving England.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.20,0:11:45.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 离开英格兰感觉会很奇怪 - 我们还没离开呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.08,0:11:47.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- We haven't left it yet. - I know, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.08,0:11:48.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我知道 但等我们到了那里 - 你还在牛津郡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.04,0:11:48.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're still in Oxfordshire I think, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.44,0:11:51.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I know, I think we are! - You haven't even left Oxfordshire yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.44,0:11:51.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我觉得我们还没有 - 你还没离开牛津郡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.48,0:11:53.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know, but that's what's going through my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.48,0:11:53.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没有 但这就是我在想的事情！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.96,0:11:56.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know when we go over there it's an hour ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.96,0:11:56.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等我们到了那里 是比这里快一个小时吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.28,0:11:57.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Is it? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.28,0:11:57.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.84,0:12:00.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.84,0:12:00.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 怎么会？ - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.00,0:12:01.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What? - How?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.00,0:12:01.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 怎么会？ - 它就是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.12,0:12:01.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It just is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.00,0:12:07.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.00,0:12:07.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但是怎么会呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.36,0:12:11.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Apart from Portugal: France, Spain, Italy, Germany,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.36,0:12:11.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}除了葡萄牙 法国、西班牙、意大利、德国
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.28,0:12:12.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}all of Europe, really, is an hour ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.28,0:12:14.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 整个欧洲都比我们快一个小时 - 我会需要倒时差吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.92,0:12:14.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Will I get jet lag?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.96,0:12:18.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, it's only like when the clocks go back and forwards in England.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.96,0:12:18.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不会 就像英国时钟 往前拨或往后拨一样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.76,0:12:20.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.76,0:12:20.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.12,0:12:25.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As "Ranulph Fiennes" and I headed towards the Channel Tunnel,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.12,0:12:24.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当这位“大探险家”和我…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.68,0:12:25.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（多佛 海峡隧道）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.60,0:12:30.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I explained the thinking behind our fact-finding mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.60,0:12:28.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…驶向英吉利海峡隧道时 我解释了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.80,0:12:30.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们这次考察任务背后的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.88,0:12:33.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, when I was at LAMMA, I started to realise
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.88,0:12:33.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 我在LAMMA农机展上的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.68,0:12:38.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we've got to get more tech.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.68,0:12:38.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我开始意识到 我们必须引进更多科技
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.00,0:12:40.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- We've gotta get more modern. - The future.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.00,0:12:40.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们必须变得更现代化 - 未来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.00,0:12:41.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.00,0:12:42.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}事情是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.00,0:12:42.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.48,0:12:44.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I once did that programme Who Do You Think You Are?,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.48,0:12:44.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我曾经做过一个节目 《你以为你是谁？》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.72,0:12:46.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}where you trace your family tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.72,0:12:46.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是档追溯家谱的节目
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.32,0:12:47.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.32,0:12:51.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我发现 我来自一个叫基尔纳的家族 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.40,0:12:51.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And I discovered that I'm from this family called the Kilners, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.28,0:12:53.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}My great-grandmother was a Kilner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.28,0:12:53.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的曾祖母是基尔纳家的人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.08,0:12:57.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And they had this huge company that made glass, huge, massive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.08,0:12:57.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们有一个很大的公司 是做玻璃器皿的 非常大 规模巨大
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.64,0:13:01.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They had two factories, each of which covered an area of 17 acres.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.64,0:13:01.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们有两家工厂 每家都占地十七英亩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.52,0:13:02.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Holy moly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.52,0:13:02.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.44,0:13:03.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- They're big. - Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.44,0:13:03.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 规模巨大 - 哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.36,0:13:07.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you bought anything in the world that was in glass,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.36,0:13:07.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}世界上但凡你买到的玻璃制品
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.00,0:13:10.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so a Gin Sling in Singapore, a bottle of pills in Texas,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.00,0:13:10.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}比如在新加坡喝一杯金酒鸡尾酒 德克萨斯的药瓶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.24,0:13:13.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it almost certainly came in a bottle made by the Kilners.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.24,0:13:13.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}几乎可以肯定 用的都是基尔纳公司生产的瓶子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.60,0:13:14.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah. - They were massive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.60,0:13:14.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 他们当时规模巨大
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.80,0:13:17.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Anyway, they didn't modernise. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.80,0:13:17.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 总之 他们没有现代化 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.40,0:13:20.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And all these little glassmakers were coming along
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.40,0:13:20.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后那些小玻璃制造商纷纷出现 用上了现代技术
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.28,0:13:22.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- using modern technology. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.28,0:13:22.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.64,0:13:25.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And before you knew it, Kilners had gone 'cause they didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.64,0:13:25.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}转眼之间 基尔纳就没了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.04,0:13:28.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- They were stuck in the past. - They were stuck in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.04,0:13:27.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 因为他们没有… - 他们固步自封
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.28,0:13:28.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 他们固步自封 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.92,0:13:31.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And they were wiped out. And they were wiped out really quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.92,0:13:31.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们很快就销声匿迹了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.68,0:13:34.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I think Diddly Squat's got to get a bit more techy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.68,0:13:34.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 我觉得迪丽斯库阿特 得增加点科技含量了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.44,0:13:36.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah. - That's what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.44,0:13:36.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 我就是这个意思
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.88,0:13:38.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And in Holland,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.88,0:13:42.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且据我所知 荷兰人在农业方面非常精细
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.64,0:13:42.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}they're very fastidious in their farming, as far as I can work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.56,0:13:46.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I was reading the other day they're the most efficient farmers in Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.56,0:13:46.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我前几天好像读到过 他们是欧洲效率最高的农民
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.12,0:13:48.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Really? - The Danes and the Dutch, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.12,0:13:48.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 真的吗？ - 丹麦人和荷兰人 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.96,0:13:54.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（阿什福德 海峡隧道 多佛）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.48,0:13:56.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Twelve miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.48,0:13:56.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有19公里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.84,0:14:00.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've got butterflies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.84,0:14:00.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我有点紧张了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.08,0:14:01.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Have you? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.08,0:14:01.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是吗？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.08,0:14:06.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What number plate's that then?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.08,0:14:06.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那个车牌是哪个国家的？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.12,0:14:08.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Dutch. - Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.12,0:14:08.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 荷兰的 - 是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.92,0:14:10.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"NL"? What does it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.92,0:14:10.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“NL” 什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.48,0:14:13.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Netherlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.48,0:14:13.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}荷兰
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.76,0:14:17.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"P".
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.76,0:14:17.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“P”
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.04,0:14:18.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Portugal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.04,0:14:18.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}葡萄牙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.80,0:14:22.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Denmark, "D".
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.80,0:14:22.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丹麦 “D”
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.60,0:14:24.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.60,0:14:24.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}德国
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.44,0:14:27.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- For a "D"? - Deutschland.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.44,0:14:27.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“D”代表德国？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.00,0:14:30.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You'd have thought they'd put a "G" on it for Germany, wouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.00,0:14:30.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你可能会觉得 他们应该用“G”代表德国
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.92,0:14:33.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You'd have thought they'd put a "G" on it for Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.92,0:14:33.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你会觉得他们会用“G”代表德国
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.48,0:14:36.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, but they call themselves Deutschland, remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.48,0:14:36.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 但他们自称德意志 记得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.60,0:14:37.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.60,0:14:37.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 为什么？ - 他们就是这么叫自己的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.80,0:14:40.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That's what they named themselves. - 'Cause everyone hates Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.80,0:14:40.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为大家都讨厌德国？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.08,0:14:45.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（海峡隧道 服务交通）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.88,0:14:47.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（穿梭列车）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.64,0:14:49.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（客运交通）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.72,0:14:51.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Leaving England!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.72,0:14:51.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}离开英国了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.56,0:14:53.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Have you seen my passport? Look how shiny it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.56,0:14:53.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看到我的护照了吗？你看它多新
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.64,0:14:56.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Shinier than mine probably. - Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.64,0:14:56.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 可能比我的新 - 你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.96,0:14:58.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, blue! You've got a blue one!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.96,0:14:58.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（护照与安检）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.28,0:15:01.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Let's have a look at your passport.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.28,0:15:01.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}蓝色的！你拿到蓝色的了 让我看看你的护照
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.40,0:15:03.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, you look like a crim.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.40,0:15:03.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 你看起来像个罪犯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.48,0:15:06.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're middle name's Wayne, I didn't know that. How ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.48,0:15:06.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你的中间名是韦恩 我都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.52,0:15:09.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What do you mean "how ridiculous"? - Well, it's just funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.52,0:15:08.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 太荒唐了 - 你什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.48,0:15:09.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}开玩笑而已
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.16,0:15:13.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Once we cleared passport control,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.16,0:15:13.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}通过护照检查后
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.84,0:15:17.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Wayne started asking me about the actual tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.84,0:15:17.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}韦恩开始问我关于隧道的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.72,0:15:21.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How deep is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.72,0:15:21.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它有多深？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.20,0:15:23.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.60,0:15:25.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, it's un... it's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.60,0:15:25.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它不…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.28,0:15:28.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's underneath the bottom of the sea, if that makes sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.28,0:15:28.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它在海底下面 如果你能理解的话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.52,0:15:31.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So it's quite deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.52,0:15:31.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 还挺深的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.32,0:15:34.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, psychologically you know you're under the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.32,0:15:34.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的意思是 心理上你知道自己在海底下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.80,0:15:36.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but it's only the same as being in a tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.80,0:15:36.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但感觉和在山洞里是一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.64,0:15:38.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, you've never been in a tunnel, have you? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.64,0:15:39.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你从来没进过隧道 对吧？ - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.52,0:15:39.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.68,0:15:41.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.68,0:15:41.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.28,0:15:43.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How many trains are down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.28,0:15:43.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}下面有多少列火车？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.80,0:15:45.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.80,0:15:45.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.20,0:15:47.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- How many carriages does it pull? - Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.20,0:15:47.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它有多少节车厢？ - 不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.92,0:15:50.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- How many cars does it fit on a carriage? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.92,0:15:49.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一节车厢能装多少辆车？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.92,0:15:50.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.92,0:15:53.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When was the Titanic? When was the Titanic?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.92,0:15:53.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}泰坦尼克号是什么时候？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.64,0:15:55.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}1912.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.64,0:15:55.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}1912年
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.64,0:15:59.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}OK, so this was after... This was obviously...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.64,0:15:59.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 所以这是在…这显然是在…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.56,0:16:00.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Well after. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.56,0:16:02.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 之后 是1988年 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.76,0:16:02.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This was 1988.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.60,0:16:09.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Holy shit, how wide is it? - The train's quite wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.60,0:16:08.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪 它有多宽？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.64,0:16:09.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}火车挺宽的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.56,0:16:16.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And here we go, we are mounting the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.56,0:16:16.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 我们上火车了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.76,0:16:22.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's weird to think this is the first train you've ever been on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.76,0:16:22.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}想想这是你第一次坐火车 感觉很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.16,0:16:25.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And I bet not many people
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.16,0:16:25.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我敢打赌没多少人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.32,0:16:29.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}are able to say that the first train they ever went on was a Eurostar train.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.32,0:16:29.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}能说他们坐的第一列火车是欧洲之星
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.76,0:16:36.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You can get out, stretch your legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.76,0:16:36.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你可以下车 伸伸腿…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.44,0:16:38.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm gonna stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.44,0:16:38.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我想待在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.64,0:16:41.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What? You don't wanna get out? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.64,0:16:40.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么？你不想下车？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.56,0:16:41.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不想
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.52,0:16:46.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You do look nervous. - I fucking am!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.52,0:16:46.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你确实看起来很紧张 - 我他妈就是紧张！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.16,0:16:50.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How do they put oxygen down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.16,0:16:50.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们在下面怎么供应氧气？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.68,0:16:52.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What do you mean? - Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.68,0:16:52.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.92,0:16:54.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How do they get oxygen flowing through the...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.92,0:16:54.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们怎么让氧气流通…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.52,0:16:58.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It just goes... It's not sealed at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.52,0:16:58.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它就是…隧道两头不是密封的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.48,0:17:03.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If there's two holes at either end, it's full of air.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.48,0:17:03.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果两头都有口子 里面就全是空气
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.92,0:17:07.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know, but surely you've gotta push the air down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.92,0:17:07.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 但你肯定 得把空气压下去吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.12,0:17:09.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- No. - Air rises up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.12,0:17:09.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不 空气… - 空气会上升
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.12,0:17:13.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, it doesn't. Air goes in any direction it wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.12,0:17:13.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不用 不是的 空气会往任何方向流动
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.44,0:17:17.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And if you go so far under the sea, air doesn't travel through water.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.44,0:17:17.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你在海底那么深的地方 空气是不能穿过水的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.60,0:17:20.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're not. No, but either end isn't under the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.60,0:17:20.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你不是…不 但是空气… 两头都不在水下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.96,0:17:22.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're going into a hole
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.96,0:17:25.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}隧道两端不在水下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.36,0:17:25.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which is above the ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.36,0:17:27.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}above the waterline...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.36,0:17:26.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}入口是在地面以上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.96,0:17:29.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（五分钟后…）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.36,0:17:32.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Let's say this is the sea, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.36,0:17:32.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 比如说这是大海 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.96,0:17:35.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- The hole starts here... - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.96,0:17:35.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 洞口从这里开始…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.00,0:17:39.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And here, and goes down like this. The air is only gonna fill here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.00,0:17:37.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 这里 然后往下延伸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.16,0:17:39.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 空气只会充满这里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.24,0:17:42.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's air in the tunnel, Kaleb. I promise there's air.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.24,0:17:42.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}隧道里有空气 卡莱布 我保证有空气
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.60,0:17:45.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You don't need scuba outfits to cope.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.60,0:17:45.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你不需要潜水装备
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.84,0:17:47.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There will be air.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.84,0:17:47.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}肯定有空气的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.64,0:17:49.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ooh, we're moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.64,0:17:49.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们在动了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.28,0:17:51.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.28,0:17:51.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.20,0:17:54.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.20,0:17:54.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.64,0:18:00.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Luckily, the tunnel didn't spring a leak
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.64,0:18:00.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}幸运的是 这趟旅程中
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.88,0:18:04.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}or run out of oxygen on that particular journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.88,0:18:04.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}隧道既没漏水也没缺氧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.88,0:18:10.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And half an hour after setting off, we were in France.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.88,0:18:10.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}出发半小时后 我们到了法国
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.20,0:18:12.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're abroad!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.20,0:18:12.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你出国了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.60,0:18:14.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm out of England.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.60,0:18:14.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我离开英国了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.28,0:18:18.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It feels weird, dunnit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.28,0:18:18.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}感觉很奇怪 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.04,0:18:20.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Well... - Just think five years ago, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.04,0:18:20.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗯… - 想想五年前吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.08,0:18:23.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know, five years, you'd not been out of Chipping Norton. Now look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.08,0:18:23.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 五年前 你连奇平诺顿 都没出过 看看现在的你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.72,0:18:25.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're like James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.72,0:18:25.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你就像詹姆斯邦德
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.88,0:18:29.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（荷兰 比利时 法国）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.92,0:18:32.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We crossed the border into Belgium...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.92,0:18:32.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们越过边境进入比利时
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.96,0:18:37.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and eventually reached our overnight halt in the city of Bruges.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.96,0:18:37.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}最终到达了我们 在布鲁日市的中途停留点…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.44,0:18:38.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（布鲁日）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.08,0:18:43.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Which I was keen for Kaleb to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.08,0:18:43.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…我很想让卡莱布看看这里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.56,0:18:51.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.56,0:18:51.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}哇
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.84,0:18:54.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is what abroad is like.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.84,0:18:54.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}国外就是这个样子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.76,0:18:56.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Everywhere is like that. - That's very pretty, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.76,0:18:56.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 哪儿都这样 - 很漂亮 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.64,0:18:58.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. Abroad is pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.64,0:18:58.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 国外很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.96,0:19:01.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I thought you'd be like Karl Pilkington coming abroad,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.96,0:19:01.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我以为你出国会像卡尔皮尔金顿那样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.40,0:19:03.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but you're not, you're actually liking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.40,0:19:03.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但你不是 你居然很喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.24,0:19:06.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, it's nice. I dunno, it's the views, look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.24,0:19:06.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这挺好的 我说不上来 这景色挺美的 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.64,0:19:08.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, it's really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.64,0:19:08.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 真的很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.80,0:19:13.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So they've actually got some of Jesus's blood in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.80,0:19:13.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那里居然存放着一些耶稣的血
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.32,0:19:16.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- The actual blood? - It's the only example in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.32,0:19:16.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我觉得是世界上唯一一处 - 真的血？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.92,0:19:18.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How do they know it's his?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.92,0:19:18.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们怎么知道是他的？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.68,0:19:23.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, now, let's not get bogged down with how they know things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.68,0:19:23.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们别纠结于他们怎么知道的了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.32,0:19:25.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, it's like barred up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.32,0:19:25.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我是说 它被栏杆围起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.08,0:19:26.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, it would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.08,0:19:29.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那肯定 想象一下 你把耶稣的血偷走了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.60,0:19:29.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Imagine if you stole Jesus's blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.36,0:19:30.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What'd it be worth?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.36,0:19:30.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那能值多少钱？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.72,0:19:33.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think if you took it to the market at Chipping Norton and said
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.72,0:19:33.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得如果你把它 拿到奇平诺顿的市场说
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.80,0:19:35.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"This is Jesus's blood", they probably wouldn't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.80,0:19:35.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“这是耶稣的血” 他们不会相信的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.96,0:19:39.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They'd tell me to fuck off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.96,0:19:39.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们会让我滚蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.20,0:19:41.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh look!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.20,0:19:41.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.04,0:19:45.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now I like this bit here where you can see down the canal, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.04,0:19:45.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我喜欢这一段 你可以看到运河的景色 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.60,0:19:48.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's really pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.60,0:19:48.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真的很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.00,0:19:50.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.00,0:19:50.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}哇
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.48,0:19:53.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's so beautifully lit, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.48,0:19:53.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}灯光太美了 不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.24,0:19:56.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.24,0:19:56.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.80,0:19:59.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Have they got crocodiles here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.80,0:19:59.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这里有鳄鱼吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.76,0:20:07.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What? - No, they don't have crocodiles here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.76,0:20:07.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 怎么了？ - 不 这里没有鳄鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.56,0:20:15.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The next morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.56,0:20:15.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第二天早上 我们出发前往荷兰边境
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.52,0:20:20.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we set off to the Dutch border to meet our first high-tech farmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.52,0:20:20.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}去见我们的第一位高科技农民
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.52,0:20:23.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And I was very much looking forward to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.52,0:20:23.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我非常期待这一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.28,0:20:26.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What he's doing is very old-fashioned farming:
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.28,0:20:26.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他做的是非常传统的农业
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.88,0:20:30.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}know your farm, know every square inch of your farm,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.88,0:20:30.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}了解你的农场 了解农场的每一寸土地
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.08,0:20:34.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but use modern technology to get the best out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.08,0:20:34.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但利用现代技术把它做到最好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.64,0:20:40.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've got really excited about this streamlining Diddly Squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.64,0:20:40.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我对精简迪丽斯库阿特感到非常兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.44,0:20:41.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It needs it. - It does.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.44,0:20:41.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它确实需要
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.72,0:20:44.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're busy fools at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.72,0:20:44.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 确实需要 - 我们现在就是瞎忙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.12,0:20:46.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's a good way of putting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.12,0:20:46.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这么说很准确
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.40,0:20:49.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh I know why. I know why we're busy fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.40,0:20:47.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道原因
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.44,0:20:49.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道我们为什么是瞎忙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.16,0:20:51.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Why? 'Cause of me? Is it me? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.16,0:20:51.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为什么？因为我吗？是我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.16,0:20:53.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, I thought it might be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.16,0:20:53.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 好吧 我也觉得可能是我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.20,0:20:56.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I wanted to try lots of different types of farming...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.20,0:20:56.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我想尝试不同类型的农业 现在我已经试了个遍…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.48,0:20:57.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Agreed, but you wake up and go:
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.48,0:20:57.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}同意 但你每天早上醒来 会说：“我知道了 今天…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.80,0:21:00.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- "I know, today... pigs." - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.80,0:21:00.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 养猪！” - 对！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.12,0:21:02.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"And we're gonna put 'em in the furthest place on the farm away from the farm."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.12,0:21:02.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“然后把它们放在农场最远的地方”
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.52,0:21:06.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, that was a mistake. And they've eaten and killed all the trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.52,0:21:04.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-“远离农场” - 对 那是个错误
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.84,0:21:06.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们把树都吃了 还弄死了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.60,0:21:08.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Oh no, what about goats? Let's get some goats.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.60,0:21:08.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“不 那山羊呢？我们养山羊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.52,0:21:10.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah. Now, where are we gonna put them?" - Well, I like the goats.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.52,0:21:10.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 现在拿它们怎么办？” - 我喜欢山羊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.52,0:21:13.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"We'll move them around and fence it off an area
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.52,0:21:13.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“我知道怎么办 我们给它们挪地方 围出一块地
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.52,0:21:16.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to build that shelter three thousand times a year."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.52,0:21:16.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来搭棚子 一年搭三千次”
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.28,0:21:18.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But, they're great animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.28,0:21:18.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但山羊确实是好动物
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.84,0:21:21.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"I know what we're gonna do now. I want chickens in that wood over there,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.84,0:21:21.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“我知道现在我们该干什么了 我想在那边的林子里养鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.36,0:21:24.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but I don't wanna see their huts so put them on the other side of the fence."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.36,0:21:24.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我不想看见它们的鸡舍 所以把鸡舍放在栅栏的另一边”
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.96,0:21:26.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, I did do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.96,0:21:26.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 我确实那么干了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.12,0:21:29.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"But we'll only get fifty and have them all in three different pens."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.12,0:21:29.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“但我们只养五十只 把它们分在三个不同的围栏里”
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.64,0:21:32.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah, we did do that. - "That's not a bad idea that."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.64,0:21:32.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 我们确实那么干了 -“这主意倒不坏”
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.36,0:21:35.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I did do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.36,0:21:35.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我确实那么干了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.32,0:21:37.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, they're three different types.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.32,0:21:37.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们是三个不同的品种
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.76,0:21:39.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They can still run together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.76,0:21:39.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们还是可以混在一起跑的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.12,0:21:47.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}On the way, we stopped to fill up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.12,0:21:47.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}路上 我们停下来加油
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.92,0:21:49.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, let's have some Super 98.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.92,0:21:49.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们要98号
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.76,0:21:50.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Super, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.76,0:21:50.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}98号 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.52,0:21:54.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And as the petrol station had a chip van,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.52,0:21:54.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}加油站有一辆薯条车
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.40,0:21:58.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I introduced Kaleb to Belgium's national dish.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.40,0:21:58.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}于是我向卡莱布介绍了比利时的国菜
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.40,0:22:01.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause the French fry was invented in Belgium.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.40,0:22:01.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为薯条是比利时发明的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.52,0:22:02.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.52,0:22:02.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是吗？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.52,0:22:06.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. You're never more than six feet from a bag of chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.52,0:22:06.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你离一袋薯条的距离永远不超过两米
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.96,0:22:08.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hi, mate. What are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.96,0:22:08.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嗨 哥们 那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.32,0:22:11.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Meatballs. - Meatballs?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.32,0:22:11.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 肉丸 - 肉丸？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.32,0:22:12.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Cow. - Cow?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.32,0:22:12.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 牛 - 牛？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.84,0:22:13.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Beef. - Beef.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.84,0:22:13.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 牛？牛肉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.80,0:22:16.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, OK, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.80,0:22:15.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 牛肉 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.28,0:22:16.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.24,0:22:18.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll have one of those and a bag of chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.24,0:22:18.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}给我来一份那个 再来一份薯条
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.84,0:22:21.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- And then you've gotta put mayonnaise on. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.84,0:22:21.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 - 然后你得加蛋黄酱
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.04,0:22:23.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've seen Pulp Fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.04,0:22:23.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 为什么？ - 你看过《低俗小说》吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.52,0:22:25.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Pop picture"? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.52,0:22:26.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 低俗什么？你什么意思？ -《低俗小说》
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.56,0:22:26.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Pulp Fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.00,0:22:30.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What do you mean? - Oh God.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.00,0:22:30.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你什么意思？ - 天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.60,0:22:34.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.60,0:22:34.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.64,0:22:39.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Meatballs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.64,0:22:39.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}肉丸
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.80,0:22:41.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.80,0:22:41.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.08,0:22:54.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Thank you. Oh no, I've gotta pay you. How much is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.08,0:22:53.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.32,0:22:55.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 我得付钱 多少钱？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.12,0:22:56.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's, er...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.12,0:22:56.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.28,0:23:04.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know your earlobes are completely see-through?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.28,0:23:04.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道你的耳垂完全是透明的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.48,0:23:16.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}After "Wayne Ramsay" had given his verdict on the meatballs,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.48,0:23:15.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“韦恩拉姆齐”对肉丸给出评价后…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.48,0:23:16.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（安特卫普 根特）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.44,0:23:18.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we reached our first farm,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.44,0:23:18.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…我们到达了第一个农场
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.40,0:23:22.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which straddles the Belgian and Dutch border.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.40,0:23:22.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它横跨比利时和荷兰的边界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.16,0:23:26.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And there, we met its gigantic owner,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.16,0:23:26.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在那里 我们见到了它高大的主人 土豆农民雅各布范登博恩
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.40,0:23:29.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}potato farmer Jacob van den Borne.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.40,0:23:29.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很高兴认识你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.88,0:23:31.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I told you everyone in Holland was tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.88,0:23:31.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我告诉过你荷兰人都很高
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.80,0:23:33.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's very tall. I feel very short now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.80,0:23:33.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他非常高 我现在觉得自己很矮
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.64,0:23:35.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah. - Even taller than you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.64,0:23:35.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 他比你还高！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.04,0:23:42.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jacob's farm is about the same size as Diddly Squat,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.04,0:23:42.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}雅各布的农场 和迪丽斯库阿特规模差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.32,0:23:47.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but judging by the amount of equipment he has in his city-sized sheds...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.32,0:23:47.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但从他那些像城市一样巨大的仓库里 拥有的设备数量来看…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.36,0:23:49.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.36,0:23:49.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.16,0:23:51.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.16,0:23:51.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真是难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.56,0:23:56.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}...it was clear he was more successful at turning his acres into cash
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.56,0:23:56.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…很明显 他比我们更擅长
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.64,0:23:59.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}than we were.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.64,0:23:59.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把土地变成现金
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.52,0:24:03.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've got parking spaces in your sheds for your tractors!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.52,0:24:03.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你的仓库里还有停拖拉机的车位
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.84,0:24:06.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And look at those trailers. Look at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.84,0:24:06.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看那些拖拉机 你看它们
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.36,0:24:08.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The sprayers, though, that's unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.36,0:24:08.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但这些喷雾器 真是难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.84,0:24:11.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's your chemical sprayer and that's your liquid fert.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.84,0:24:11.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是化学喷雾器 那是液体肥料
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.32,0:24:14.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Er, actually, it's a twin-tank system.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.32,0:24:14.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它其实是双罐系统
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.16,0:24:15.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh wow, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.16,0:24:17.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 哇 你看那个 难以置信 - 所以我们能装九千升…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.48,0:24:17.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So we do nine thousand litres of... - Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.32,0:24:19.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's two sprayers in one, Kaleb!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.32,0:24:20.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 一车顶两车 卡莱布 - 哇
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.36,0:24:20.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.28,0:24:22.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So we can do two sprays... - Look at his little face!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.28,0:24:22.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 所以我们一次能喷两种 - 你看他那小表情
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.36,0:24:25.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- ...in one go. - That's unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.36,0:24:26.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 真是难以置信 - 你会兴奋到爆的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.00,0:24:27.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're going to need a trolley for your cock.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.36,0:24:31.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So this is variable rate. The tyres' inflating system.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.36,0:24:31.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是变量控制技术 轮胎充气系统
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.64,0:24:33.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you can let the tyres down
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.64,0:24:33.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以你可以边开边给轮胎
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.48,0:24:35.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and pump them up while you're driving along?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.48,0:24:35.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 放气和充气？ - 对 实际上我所有的拖拉机
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.12,0:24:38.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Actually all my tractors, most of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.12,0:24:38.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}大部分也都配有可充气轮胎
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.28,0:24:40.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}also have inflating tyres.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.28,0:24:43.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 如果这里每样东西 都值五十万欧元 大概差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.12,0:24:42.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}OK, if everything in here is half a million euros,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.04,0:24:45.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which it probably is, except for the stuff that's more...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.04,0:24:45.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}除了那些更贵的…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.80,0:24:47.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's ten million quid in this shed?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.80,0:24:47.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这个仓库值一千万英镑？ - 两千万欧元？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.04,0:24:49.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Twenty million euros? - In here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.04,0:24:49.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 在这里？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.04,0:24:50.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Well, yeah. - Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.04,0:24:50.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.96,0:24:54.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And again, a two-tank system.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.96,0:24:54.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这也是双罐系统
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.84,0:24:59.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And look, I'm gonna be boring, I'm gonna talk about this floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.84,0:24:59.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 我可能要讲点无聊的了 我要说说这个地面
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.32,0:25:02.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This floor is designed so that air can come up from underneath it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.32,0:25:02.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这个地面的设计是可以从下面通风的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.68,0:25:05.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So if you store potatoes or whatever you want to store on it,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.68,0:25:05.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 如果你在上面储存土豆 或任何你想储存的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.64,0:25:07.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}they're ventilated from underneath.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.64,0:25:07.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们就能从底部通风
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.36,0:25:10.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How much does that cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.36,0:25:10.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那要花多少钱？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.00,0:25:13.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can smell the potatoes now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.00,0:25:13.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我现在能闻到土豆味了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.00,0:25:15.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is what our storage room looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.00,0:25:15.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们的储藏室就是这个样子
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.36,0:25:18.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.36,0:25:19.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.00,0:25:19.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jesus H Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.68,0:25:21.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shall we have a game of football, or three?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.68,0:25:21.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们踢场足球吧 或者三场？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.68,0:25:24.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This shed can hold 6,500 tonnes
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.68,0:25:24.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这个仓库能容纳六千五百吨
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.28,0:25:29.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}from the 32,000 tonnes of potatoes that we can store in total.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.28,0:25:29.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而我们总共能储存三万两千吨土豆
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.00,0:25:30.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fucking hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.00,0:25:30.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我靠
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.76,0:25:33.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know we could put all our barns in this barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.76,0:25:33.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道 我们所有谷仓的东西 都能装进这个谷仓里
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.48,0:25:35.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I know. - And my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.48,0:25:35.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我知道 对 - 还有我的房子
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.48,0:25:37.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, and all of Chadlington.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.48,0:25:37.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有整个查德灵顿
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.76,0:25:40.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So, another Fendt? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.76,0:25:40.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那又是一台芬特？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.40,0:25:45.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I should explain. We keep seeing Fendts, lots of Fendts, huge Fendts.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.40,0:25:45.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我得解释一下 我们不停地看到 芬特拖拉机 数量多 体型大
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.44,0:25:50.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They really are the sort of most expensive tractors you can buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.44,0:25:46.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（芬特）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.36,0:25:50.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们确实是你能买到的最贵的拖拉机
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.36,0:25:53.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're like high-end Mercedes-Benz tractors.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.36,0:25:53.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们就像是高端梅赛德斯奔驰拖拉机
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.92,0:25:58.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And he's got three in every shed!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.92,0:25:58.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他每个仓库里都有三台
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.92,0:26:00.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.92,0:26:00.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}全都从那里来的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.96,0:26:03.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause he's adopting the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.96,0:26:03.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为他正在拥抱未来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.80,0:26:10.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Unsurprisingly, Jacob also has one other piece of equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.80,0:26:10.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不出所料 雅各布还有另一件设备…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.44,0:26:14.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I had chips for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.44,0:26:14.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我早餐吃了薯条
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.00,0:26:17.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Chips again. Oh, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.00,0:26:15.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}又是薯条
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.40,0:26:17.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.16,0:26:20.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}After Kaleb had finished his second breakfast,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.16,0:26:20.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布吃完他的第二顿早餐后…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.12,0:26:27.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jacob then explained how he'd made his farm so successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.12,0:26:23.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（农业未来 一同创造 雅各布范登博恩）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.32,0:26:27.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…雅各布接着解释 他是如何让他的农场如此成功的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.24,0:26:29.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And when I went in my fields, when I started this,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.24,0:26:29.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我刚接手这个农场的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.72,0:26:33.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I took over the farm from my father in 2006,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.72,0:26:33.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是在2006年 从我父亲手里接过来的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.08,0:26:34.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I went to one field
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.08,0:26:37.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我去了其中一块地 在一处收获了30吨土豆
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.68,0:26:37.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and I harvested 30 tonnes on one spot of potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.44,0:26:43.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The other part, same field, same seed, everything the same,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.44,0:26:43.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而在另一处 尽管是同一块地 用了同样的种子 什么都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.04,0:26:44.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}90 tonnes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.04,0:26:44.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}却收获了90吨
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.36,0:26:47.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's a difference of 60 tonnes in one field.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.36,0:26:47.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}同一块地里差了60吨
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.24,0:26:48.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And what was causing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.24,0:26:48.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是什么原因造成的？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.48,0:26:50.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And that's what we're gonna figure out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.48,0:26:50.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就是我们要搞清楚的事
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.72,0:26:54.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So in 2009 we then started precision farming.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.72,0:26:53.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 2009年 我们开始了精准农业
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.40,0:26:54.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（精准农业 范登博恩土豆）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.08,0:26:55.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A lot of people talk about...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.08,0:26:59.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All farmers like to know the quality of their soil.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.08,0:26:58.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（精准农业最重要的数据是什么？）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.48,0:27:00.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（产量数据 产量潜力 土壤 种子 天气）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.44,0:27:05.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But Jacob takes this job to another level
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.44,0:27:05.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所有农民都想知道土壤质量 但雅各布把这工作提升到了另一层次
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.00,0:27:08.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}by using specially developed equipment
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.00,0:27:08.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他使用专门开发的设备
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.40,0:27:11.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to give him ultra-precise readings
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.40,0:27:11.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来获取地下的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.36,0:27:15.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}from under the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.36,0:27:15.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}超精确读数
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.88,0:27:18.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So everything in the soil that conducts,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.88,0:27:18.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}土壤里所有能导电的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.40,0:27:21.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so organic matter, that's water, that's nutrients,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.40,0:27:21.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}比如有机质、水分、养分
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.92,0:27:24.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}every part in the soil that is conducting
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.92,0:27:26.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}土壤里每一部分能导电的东西 都会给我传回数据
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.48,0:27:26.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}is giving me the data back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.80,0:27:30.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do the scan, process that data and you'll get that map.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.80,0:27:30.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}进行扫描 处理那些数据 你就会得到那张地图
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.44,0:27:33.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh, is that a field? - That's one of my fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.44,0:27:33.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那是一片田地吗？ - 那是我的一块地
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.88,0:27:37.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The red spots there are more conducting
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.88,0:27:39.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}红色区域表明其导电性更强 因此产量也更高
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.16,0:27:39.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and therefore bigger in yield.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.48,0:27:44.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Once he knows where the weakest and strongest patches of soil are,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.48,0:27:44.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一旦知道了土壤最薄弱 和最肥沃的区域在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.40,0:27:48.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jacob can then programme his tractors
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.40,0:27:48.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}雅各布就可以给他的拖拉机编程
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.00,0:27:51.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to fertilise and seed each part of the field
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.00,0:27:51.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}让它们根据田里每部分的需求
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.48,0:27:53.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}according to its need.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.48,0:27:53.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来施肥和播种
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.52,0:27:58.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}My tractors I programme to be
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.52,0:28:00.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的拖拉机 我给它们编程 让它们自动检测土壤
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.56,0:28:00.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}automatically detecting soil.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.80,0:28:04.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Then, they do the job, and at the end, when my driver drives off the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.80,0:28:04.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后它们干活 最后 当我的司机开出田地时
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.52,0:28:06.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the tractor recognises, "Oh, you're done!"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.52,0:28:06.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}拖拉机会识别：“任务完成”
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.36,0:28:11.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you tell the tractor to do different things
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.36,0:28:11.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以你让拖拉机在同一块田的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.00,0:28:13.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}in different parts of the field, the same field?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.00,0:28:14.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不同区域做不同的事情？ - 不同位置 对
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.48,0:28:14.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.40,0:28:18.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Seeding, fertilising, that's all "variable rate".
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.40,0:28:18.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}播种、施肥 全都采用了变量控制
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.44,0:28:22.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And when it comes to tackling unwanted weeds,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.44,0:28:20.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（传感器数据）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.40,0:28:22.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而在处理杂草时…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.60,0:28:23.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（植被覆盖率%）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.52,0:28:27.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}he doesn't carpet bomb the field with herbicides like we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.52,0:28:24.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（出苗率%）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.44,0:28:27.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…他不会像我们那样 用除草剂对田地进行地毯式轰炸
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.56,0:28:30.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Instead, he uses his high-tech maps
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.56,0:28:30.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}相反 他使用高科技地图…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.36,0:28:33.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to do precision spraying.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.36,0:28:31.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（杂草检测）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.28,0:28:32.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…进行精准喷洒
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.96,0:28:34.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（高温 低温）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.12,0:28:36.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We can actually detect those spots
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.12,0:28:36.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们实际上可以检测那些位置 只杀死那些杂草…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.52,0:28:39.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and actually only kill those weeds
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.52,0:28:39.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（BB LEAP 变量喷洒与施肥）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.60,0:28:41.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}without touching the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.60,0:28:41.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…其他地方碰都不碰
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.52,0:28:44.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So they're spraying, see, it just goes and when it sees a weed, "choo".
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.52,0:28:44.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以它们正在喷洒 看到了吗？ 它那么过去 当它看到一棵杂草时…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.80,0:28:47.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's future.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.80,0:28:47.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这…这就是未来
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.08,0:28:50.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So if you're not spraying the chemicals onto the crop...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.08,0:28:50.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你不把化学药剂喷到作物上…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.08,0:28:53.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you will have a higher yield.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.08,0:28:53.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那么你的产量就会更高
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.32,0:28:56.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then you're saving maybe four grand a year on our herbicide bills.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.32,0:28:56.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后你每年大概能省下 四千英镑的除草剂费用
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.64,0:28:59.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you're not wasting money on any...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.64,0:29:02.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你不会浪费一分钱 每一平方米都不会白花钱
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.48,0:29:02.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}not even a square metre of the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.24,0:29:04.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- This is NASA levels. - Reduce that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.24,0:29:04.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这简直是美国航空局的技术级别
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.32,0:29:10.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And Jacob's methods don't stop at soil mapping and programmable tractors
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.32,0:29:10.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}雅各布的方法 不止于土壤测绘和可编程拖拉机
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.08,0:29:14.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because he now uses drones to spray the fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.08,0:29:14.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为他现在使用无人机来喷洒田地
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.12,0:29:18.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you look into the future in fifty years or something,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.12,0:29:18.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你展望未来五十年左右
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.00,0:29:19.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we will have tractors,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.00,0:29:23.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们仍然会有拖拉机 但很多工作也会由无人机完成
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.72,0:29:22.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but a lot of it will also be drones.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.08,0:29:26.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And he had to deploy some admirable cunning
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.08,0:29:26.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且他必须用一些相当高明的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.80,0:29:30.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to get round some very strict EU laws.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.80,0:29:30.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来绕过非常严格的欧盟法律
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.44,0:29:32.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There was only one problem, Jeremy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.44,0:29:32.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}只有一个问题 杰里米
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.80,0:29:35.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's not allowed to fly drones in Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.80,0:29:35.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在欧洲是不允许飞无人机的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.08,0:29:37.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's not allowed to fly them by computer,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.08,0:29:37.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不允许通过电脑操控它们飞行 不允许它们…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.64,0:29:40.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it's not allowed to let them swarm and let them work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.64,0:29:40.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}让它们成群结队、协同作业
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.68,0:29:43.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There is actually... You cannot do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.68,0:29:43.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}实际上 你什么都不能做
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.60,0:29:45.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So did you know what we did?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.60,0:29:45.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道我们做了什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.80,0:29:47.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I started an airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.80,0:29:47.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我开了一个机场
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.08,0:29:49.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.08,0:29:49.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 什么？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.16,0:29:52.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can fly whatever I want as high as I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.16,0:29:52.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我想飞什么就飞什么 想飞多高就飞多高
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.00,0:29:53.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What, you've made your farm an airport?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.00,0:29:53.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以你把你的农场变成了一个机场？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.76,0:29:55.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I made my farm an airport!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.76,0:29:55.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我把我的农场变成了一个机场
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.72,0:29:57.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That is so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.72,0:29:57.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这也太酷了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.64,0:30:04.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Outside, he offered to demonstrate his spraying drone,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.64,0:30:04.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在外面 他主动提出 演示他的喷洒无人机
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.32,0:30:07.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which was not what you'd call small.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.32,0:30:07.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这可不是你所说的“小玩意儿”
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.04,0:30:11.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.04,0:30:11.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.08,0:30:14.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you crash-landed that on a playground...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.08,0:30:14.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}要是那玩意坠毁在操场上…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.48,0:30:15.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, you'd be...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.48,0:30:15.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 你会…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.36,0:30:18.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It would be on the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.36,0:30:18.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那会上新闻的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.00,0:30:20.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How much spray does it...?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.00,0:30:20.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它能装多少喷洒液…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.56,0:30:23.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we have a tank of 50 litres.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.56,0:30:23.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们有一个五十升的罐
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.00,0:30:25.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And how much would this field need?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.00,0:30:25.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这块地需要多少？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.76,0:30:28.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And that will be one hectare and we can do that in 8 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.76,0:30:28.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这有一公顷 我们八分钟就能喷完
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.88,0:30:32.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I normally spray about 125 to 150 litres a hectare.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.88,0:30:32.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我通常每公顷喷洒大约125到150升
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.20,0:30:34.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you could programme it to come back to the yard,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.20,0:30:34.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以你可以给它编程 让它回到院子里 加满
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.36,0:30:37.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you just top it up and it goes back out to whatever field you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.36,0:30:37.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后再回到正在作业的任一地里？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.00,0:30:40.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't wanna do that, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.00,0:30:40.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不想那样做
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.16,0:30:41.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know, 'cause you like driving tractors.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.16,0:30:41.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我知道 因为你喜欢开拖拉机 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.80,0:30:42.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.80,0:30:45.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但作为一个即将拥抱未来的人
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.88,0:30:45.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But as a man who's about to embrace the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.44,0:30:47.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I need to be looking at this shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.44,0:30:47.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我需要关注这些东西
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.08,0:30:51.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Once its tank had been filled with weed killer,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.08,0:30:51.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等它的罐里装满了除草剂 雅各布输入了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.00,0:30:56.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jacob punched in all the information it would need for its spraying flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.00,0:30:56.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它喷洒飞行所需的所有信息
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.08,0:30:57.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lots of codes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.08,0:30:57.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好多代码
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.60,0:30:59.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How many litres are we gonna spray,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.60,0:31:01.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们要喷多少升 多大压力 多大的雾滴
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.08,0:31:01.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which pressure, which droplet size.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.04,0:31:10.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And it's spraying now. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.04,0:31:10.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它现在正在喷洒 看到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.92,0:31:12.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.92,0:31:12.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.24,0:31:18.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So it's now doing the first run.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.24,0:31:18.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以它现在正在跑第一趟
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.76,0:31:21.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Stops at the headland.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.76,0:31:21.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在地头停下
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.32,0:31:25.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Makes the turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.32,0:31:25.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}转弯
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.68,0:31:28.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I'm amazed. - And I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.68,0:31:28.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我太惊讶了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.52,0:31:31.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It's doing it by itself. - You're not touching anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.52,0:31:31.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 而且我没有…它自己完成的 - 你什么也没碰
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.12,0:31:34.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bloody hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.12,0:31:34.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.64,0:31:38.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm just so embarrassed by our drone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.64,0:31:38.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我只是为我们那架可怜的无人机
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.12,0:31:41.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Which is just pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.12,0:31:41.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}感到尴尬
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.12,0:31:46.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is actually how 80% percent of the world
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.12,0:31:46.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}实际上以后全世界百分之八十的地区 都将这样喷洒作物
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.16,0:31:48.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- is going to spray their crops. - Has to.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.16,0:31:48.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}必须这样
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.44,0:31:51.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, Kaleb, that is impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.44,0:31:51.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}拜托 卡莱布 这多厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.44,0:31:53.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And if it's really hot on a summer's day, look, I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.44,0:31:53.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}夏天天气很热的时候 我不能…我是红头发
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.40,0:31:55.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm ginger, I can't stand outside and hold that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.40,0:31:55.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我不能站在外面举着那个 - 你可以坐在车里
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.80,0:31:57.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I need to be in a cab. - You can sit in your car.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.80,0:31:59.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你可以坐在你的车里 - 坐在车里
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.52,0:31:59.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You can sit in the car. - Sit in your car.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.56,0:32:02.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If I apply to have an airport at Diddly Squat,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.56,0:32:02.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我在迪丽斯库阿特 申请建一个机场
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.20,0:32:04.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}there will be one objection from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.20,0:32:03.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}会有一个人反对…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.84,0:32:04.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就是他
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.28,0:32:09.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So he's done that field in five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.28,0:32:09.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他五分钟就喷完了那块地
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.84,0:32:12.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then he'll come and land where he started?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.84,0:32:12.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后它会飞回来降落在起飞的地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.04,0:32:13.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Automatic landing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.04,0:32:13.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}自动降落
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.12,0:32:18.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fucking hell, Kaleb, that is impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.12,0:32:18.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我靠 卡莱布 这太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.88,0:32:22.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- And also, think how quiet that is. - My tractor's quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.88,0:32:21.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有 想想它有多安静
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.52,0:32:22.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的拖拉机很安静
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.60,0:32:24.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Not as quiet as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.60,0:32:24.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没那个安静
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.36,0:32:30.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Reluctant though he was about welcoming in the new world order,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.36,0:32:30.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}尽管在我们开车离开时 卡莱布对新世界秩序的到来
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.92,0:32:36.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}as we drove away, Kaleb had to give Jacob his due.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.92,0:32:36.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很不情愿 但他还是不得不承认雅各布确实厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.40,0:32:39.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That's serious farming. - Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.40,0:32:39.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这才是正经的农业
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.44,0:32:43.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah, that man was a serious farmer. - He was a serious farmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.44,0:32:43.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 那个人是正经的农民 - 他是个正经的农民
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.24,0:32:47.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If he's got 32,000 tonnes of potatoes a year
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.24,0:32:47.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果他每年生产三万两千吨土豆 每吨两百…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.56,0:32:51.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}at £250 a tonne,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.56,0:32:51.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 五十 - …二百五十英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.16,0:32:53.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that's £8 million worth of potatoes every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.16,0:32:53.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那就是每年价值八百万英镑的土豆
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.88,0:32:54.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.88,0:32:54.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 那些设备简直离谱
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.84,0:32:58.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I mean, the kit was just ridiculous. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.84,0:32:58.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 我的脑子还在…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.04,0:33:01.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's so much information that's gone into my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.04,0:33:01.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这么多信息涌进了我的脑子里
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.76,0:33:07.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, having introduced Kaleb to some brilliant Dutch farming,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.76,0:33:07.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在让卡莱布领略了 一些出色的荷兰农业之后
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.24,0:33:11.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I decided, as we headed towards our overnight halt,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.24,0:33:11.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我决定 在我们前往过夜地点的途中
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.00,0:33:14.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to introduce him to some brilliant Dutch music.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.00,0:33:14.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}让他也领略一些出色的荷兰音乐
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.84,0:33:19.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Listen to that bass.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.84,0:33:19.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那贝斯
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.36,0:33:30.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ I've been driving all night My hands wet on the wheel ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.36,0:33:30.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我开了一整夜的车 手湿漉漉地握着方向盘
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.48,0:33:32.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's got that country feel to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.48,0:33:32.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有种乡村音乐的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.32,0:33:33.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ There's a voice in my head ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.32,0:33:35.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}脚跟都在跟着节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.88,0:33:36.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ That drives my heel ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.92,0:33:40.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ It's my baby calling says "I need you here" ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.92,0:33:40.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是我的宝贝在呼唤 说“我这里需要你”
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.92,0:33:44.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ And it's a half past four and I'm shifting gear ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.92,0:33:44.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在是四点半 我正在换挡
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.76,0:33:45.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.48,0:33:47.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.48,0:33:47.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.44,0:33:52.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ When she is lonely And the longing gets too much ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.44,0:33:52.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当她感到孤独 思念太过强烈
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.36,0:33:56.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ She sends a cable Coming in from above ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.36,0:33:56.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}她就会发送一封电报 从天而降
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.76,0:33:59.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Don't need no phone at all ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.76,0:33:59.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}根本不需要电话
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.36,0:34:03.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- ♪ We've got a thing and that's called ♪ - ♪ Radar love ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.36,0:34:02.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们有一样东西 叫做雷达之爱
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.44,0:34:03.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}雷达之爱
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.44,0:34:10.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ We've got a wave in the air Radar love ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.44,0:34:08.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们空中有电波
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.20,0:34:10.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}雷达之爱
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.20,0:34:14.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bonjour, monsieur. Je m'appelle Kaleb.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.68,0:34:15.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.68,0:34:15.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.68,0:34:17.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bonjour, monsieur. Je m'appelle Kaleb.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.92,0:34:21.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Ooh! - Do you know I learnt that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.92,0:34:21.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道我学会这句了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.84,0:34:29.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The following morning, we headed over to our next location.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.84,0:34:29.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第二天早上 我们前往下一个地点
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.28,0:34:33.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And it was mind-boggling.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.28,0:34:33.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那地方简直令人难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.24,0:34:37.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because it's a dairy farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.24,0:34:37.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为那是一个奶牛场
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.00,0:34:40.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}On water.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.00,0:34:40.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但建在水上
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.12,0:34:46.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Slap bang in the middle of Rotterdam.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.12,0:34:46.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就在鹿特丹的正中央
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.80,0:34:51.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Hello, hello. - How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.80,0:34:51.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你好 - 嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.96,0:34:55.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- How are you? - Welcome. Peter. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.96,0:34:53.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你好吗？ - 你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.40,0:34:55.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 彼得 - 欢迎 彼得
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.20,0:34:57.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Nice to meet you. - Good to meet you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.20,0:34:57.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 很高兴认识你 - 我也很高兴认识你
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.12,0:34:58.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Nice to meet you. Very welcome at our farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.12,0:34:59.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 欢迎来到我们的农场 - 这太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.88,0:34:59.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is wicked!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.80,0:35:02.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's the only time I've ever seen him smile in a city.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.80,0:35:02.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是我唯一一次看到他在城市里笑
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.20,0:35:07.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The floating farm is the brainchild of Peter van Wingerden
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.20,0:35:07.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这个漂浮农场是彼得范温格登
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.64,0:35:09.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and his wife Minke.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.64,0:35:09.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}和他的妻子明克的创意
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.08,0:35:13.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And although it's in a city, don't for one minute think
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.08,0:35:13.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}虽然它在城市里 但千万别以为
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.36,0:35:18.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that it's some kind of industrial battery-farm operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.36,0:35:18.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是那种工业化的密集养殖场
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.64,0:35:21.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sea cows?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.64,0:35:21.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}海上奶牛？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.04,0:35:23.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, correct, sea cows, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.04,0:35:23.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 没错 海上奶牛 对
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.48,0:35:27.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The cows are free to wander about in the feeding area
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.48,0:35:27.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}奶牛可以自由地在喂食区闲逛
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.24,0:35:29.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}or go ashore for a graze.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.24,0:35:29.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}也可以上岸去吃草
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.60,0:35:38.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And as for milking, they keep their own timetable.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.60,0:35:38.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}至于挤奶 它们完全按自己的节奏来
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.40,0:35:42.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Is that walking in to be milked then? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.40,0:35:42.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那只是走进去挤奶吗？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.12,0:35:45.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So the cow knows when it wants to be milked and just walks in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.12,0:35:45.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以奶牛知道什么时候该挤奶 就直接走进去？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.92,0:35:47.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.92,0:35:47.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}完全正确
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.96,0:35:52.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So this is completely automated? You can just go home and watch TV?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.96,0:35:52.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以这是全自动的？ 你可以回家看电视了…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.84,0:35:55.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Exactly. And we have many cameras over here as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.84,0:35:55.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 我们这里还有很多摄像头
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.52,0:35:58.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so we measure everything: temperature, wind speed, relative humidity,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.52,0:35:58.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我们可以测量一切 温度、风速
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.72,0:36:01.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}if the cow's lying down, if she's standing up,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.72,0:36:01.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}相对湿度 奶牛是卧着还是站着
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.96,0:36:04.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}if she's eating, if she's inside or outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.96,0:36:04.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是在吃草 是在里面还是外面
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.84,0:36:07.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because it's what we call a free-range cow, so she can decide herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.84,0:36:07.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为这就是我们所说的自由放养奶牛
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.24,0:36:10.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- How many are there? - About thirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.24,0:36:09.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 所以它可以自己决定 - 有多少头？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.64,0:36:10.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}大概三十头
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.56,0:36:11.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Thirty? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.56,0:36:11.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 三十头？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.64,0:36:16.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Although the farm covers less than an acre,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.64,0:36:16.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}虽然这个农场占地不到一英亩
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.28,0:36:19.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}its output is staggering.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.28,0:36:19.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但它的产量惊人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.00,0:36:23.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}On the floor below, the milk is pasteurised or made into butter.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.00,0:36:23.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在下面一层 牛奶经过巴氏消毒 或被制成黄油
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.64,0:36:26.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then below that...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.64,0:36:26.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后再下面一层…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.88,0:36:28.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A cheesery?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.88,0:36:28.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一个奶酪工坊？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.04,0:36:30.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}An underwater cheesery.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.04,0:36:30.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一个水下奶酪工坊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.96,0:36:35.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How much concrete have they got in this country?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.96,0:36:35.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这个国家到底用了多少混凝土？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.64,0:36:37.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How does it stay afloat?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.64,0:36:37.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它是怎么浮起来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.52,0:36:39.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is this floating or are you mounted to the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.52,0:36:39.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是漂浮着的 还是固定在…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.88,0:36:41.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, it's completely floating.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.88,0:36:41.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}完全是漂浮的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.00,0:36:42.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It's floating? - It's completely floating.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.00,0:36:42.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是漂浮的？ - 完全是漂浮的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.92,0:36:45.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we are now three metres below the sea level.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.92,0:36:45.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们现在在海平面以下三米
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.92,0:36:47.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Which keeps it cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.92,0:36:47.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这样能保持凉爽吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.04,0:36:49.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The temperature's completely controlled.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.04,0:36:49.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}温度是完全可控的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.80,0:36:51.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But even more impressive
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.80,0:36:56.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但更令人印象深刻的是 这个农场和城市之间的协作方式
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.96,0:36:55.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}is the way this farm and the city work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.60,0:36:59.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When Peter goes out delivering his dairy produce,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.60,0:36:59.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当彼得出去送他的乳制品时
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.60,0:37:02.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}he comes back with brewer's grain from the breweries
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.60,0:37:02.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他会从啤酒厂带回酿酒用的谷物…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.36,0:37:06.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and yesterday's unsold stale bread from the shops.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.36,0:37:03.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（约迪面包房 鹿特丹）
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.60,0:37:07.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…从商店带回昨天没卖掉的陈面包
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.04,0:37:08.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}None of which costs him a penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.04,0:37:08.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这些一分钱都不用花
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.68,0:37:13.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then that is made into food for the cows.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.68,0:37:13.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后用那些来做成奶牛的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.64,0:37:17.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.64,0:37:17.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看那个
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.64,0:37:20.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And this is what? A day old? Two days?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.64,0:37:20.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这个放了多久？一天？ - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.36,0:37:24.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We were wasting so much bread, and now it comes to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.36,0:37:24.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们以前浪费那么多面包 现在这些面包都送到我们这里来了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.24,0:37:26.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause the amount of waste in a city, when you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.24,0:37:26.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你想一想 城市里的垃圾数量
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.64,0:37:28.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It's unbelievable. - Organic waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.64,0:37:28.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 有机垃圾… - 真是难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.56,0:37:32.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As for the grass that's used to feed the cows,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.56,0:37:32.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}至于用来喂牛的草
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.96,0:37:35.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that comes from a very clever source.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.96,0:37:35.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来源也非常巧妙
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.80,0:37:39.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So when they cut the grass in the football stadium,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.80,0:37:39.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 当足球场割草的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.40,0:37:40.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you take the clippings?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.40,0:37:40.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们会把割下来的草拿走？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.76,0:37:42.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, from the main pitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.76,0:37:42.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 从主球场上拿来
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.12,0:37:44.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The best grass you can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.12,0:37:44.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你能得到的最好的草
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.44,0:37:46.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They put seaweed on it and everything to make it look green,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.44,0:37:46.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们会往上面撒海藻 来让它看起来更绿 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.64,0:37:49.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so therefore the nutrients of that grass must be insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.64,0:37:49.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以那些草的营养一定很丰富
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.68,0:37:51.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah, it's really good. - Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.68,0:37:51.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 非常好 - 哇
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.08,0:37:54.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And 'cause you're here you can just go and grab it all each morning and...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.08,0:37:54.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且因为你们就在这里 每天早上就能直接去拿…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.04,0:37:55.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.04,0:37:55.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 没错 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.00,0:37:57.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So this is the circularity of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.00,0:37:57.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就是城市的循环利用
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.80,0:38:02.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And this circular efficiency goes even further,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.80,0:38:02.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而这种循环效率甚至更进一步
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.36,0:38:06.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because Peter has a robot that collects all the manure
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.36,0:38:06.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为彼得有一个机器人 收集所有的粪便
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.40,0:38:11.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and that manure is then used to make drinking water for the cows.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.40,0:38:11.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后用这些粪便来制造奶牛的饮用水
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.88,0:38:14.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We take sea water out as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.88,0:38:14.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们也抽取海水 - 你们有一个海水淡化厂？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.28,0:38:17.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh, you've got a desalination plant? - This is our desalination.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.28,0:38:17.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是我们的海水淡化设备
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.84,0:38:19.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And it goes to this side of the membrane.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.84,0:38:19.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}海水进到膜的这边
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.96,0:38:23.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And we heat up the other side of the membrane
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.96,0:38:25.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们利用牛粪来加热膜的另一边
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.04,0:38:25.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}by using the cow dung.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.52,0:38:28.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So if you put cow dung in this bin,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.52,0:38:28.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 如果你把牛粪放进这个箱子里
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.24,0:38:30.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we put sea water in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.24,0:38:30.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们把海水放进来
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.12,0:38:33.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it heats up to 35, 40 degrees, you can feel it over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.12,0:38:33.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它会加热到35到40度 你在这边能感觉到
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.72,0:38:36.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So we have... - So they're drinking sea water?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.72,0:38:36.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 所以我们有… - 所以它们喝的是海水？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.52,0:38:38.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.52,0:38:38.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.04,0:38:40.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And you use their manure to desalinate it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.04,0:38:41.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你们用它们的粪便来淡化海水？ - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.88,0:38:41.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.96,0:38:45.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're using and reusing everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.96,0:38:45.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们使用并重复利用一切东西
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.68,0:38:50.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Organic waste from the city to turn it into proteins again.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.68,0:38:50.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把城市里的有机垃圾再利用 重新转化为蛋白质
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.04,0:38:52.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, yes, this is the future of farming.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.04,0:38:52.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 是的 这就是农业的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.28,0:38:56.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fuck! Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.28,0:38:56.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}操
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.56,0:39:00.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is just f... My mind is in overdrive right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.56,0:38:57.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 操 - 这简直是…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.80,0:39:00.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的大脑现在超负荷运转了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.60,0:39:02.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's about to blow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.60,0:39:02.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它要爆炸了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.28,0:39:12.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Outside, sitting by the solar panels that power the whole operation,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.28,0:39:12.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在外面 坐在为整个运营供电的 太阳能电池板旁
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.60,0:39:14.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Peter then showed us the building materials
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.60,0:39:14.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}彼得接着向我们展示了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.84,0:39:17.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}he was also making out of the manure.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.84,0:39:17.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他也在用粪便制造的建筑材料
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.00,0:39:21.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So what do you do with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.00,0:39:21.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那么 你们用这个来做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.72,0:39:23.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So this could be an inside wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.72,0:39:23.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这可以用来做内墙
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.48,0:39:25.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Insulation? - Insulation, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.48,0:39:25.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 隔热材料？ - 对 隔热材料
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.92,0:39:27.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So you could have your house insulated. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.92,0:39:27.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 所以你可以用它来做房子的隔热层 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.88,0:39:30.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Your house would be literally full of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.88,0:39:30.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那你的房子就真的全是屎了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.12,0:39:31.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.12,0:39:31.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.04,0:39:33.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- People say mine is anyway. - It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.04,0:39:33.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 反正别人也这么说我的房子 - 确实是
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.84,0:39:35.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm rarely amazed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.84,0:39:35.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我很少被惊艳到
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.52,0:39:38.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lamborghini Revuelto amazed me
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.52,0:39:38.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}兰博基尼Revuelto 让我惊艳过 还有那个
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.04,0:39:40.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and that's been it for the last year or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.04,0:39:40.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在过去一年左右的时间里 就这两样
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.52,0:39:43.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And that's taking virtually nothing from the environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.52,0:39:43.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而那个几乎不消耗任何环境资源
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.40,0:39:44.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Exactly. - And it's giving more back!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.40,0:39:44.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.32,0:39:47.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's an almost zero footprint.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.32,0:39:47.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 而且它回馈得更多 - 几乎零碳足迹
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.08,0:39:49.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.08,0:39:49.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太惊人了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.08,0:39:52.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We actually want to reduce food losses.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.08,0:39:52.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们实际上想要减少食物损失
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.24,0:39:54.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because food losses is dramatic in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.24,0:39:54.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为全球的食物损失非常惊人
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.92,0:39:56.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're losing so much food.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.92,0:39:56.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们损失了太多食物
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.48,0:39:58.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}About 30% of all food produced is lost in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.48,0:39:58.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}全世界生产的食物中
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.88,0:40:02.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}while still one billion people doesn't have food.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.88,0:40:00.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 大约三成都被浪费了 - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.36,0:40:02.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而与此同时 还有十亿人没有食物
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.76,0:40:04.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we need to change this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.76,0:40:04.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 我们需要改变这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.40,0:40:06.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And this can only be done if you produce local.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.40,0:40:06.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而这只有通过本地生产才能实现
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.96,0:40:09.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So what we've established
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.96,0:40:09.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 我们得出的结论是
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.12,0:40:13.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}is Diddly Squat is in the wrong location because it's in the countryside.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.12,0:40:13.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}迪丽斯库阿特的位置不对 因为它在乡下
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.68,0:40:15.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And it's not floating.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.68,0:40:15.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且它不是漂浮的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.28,0:40:18.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's where there are fields that's wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.28,0:40:18.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}问题就出在它旁边是田地
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.88,0:40:28.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Obviously, I couldn't relocate Diddly Squat to the River Thames.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.88,0:40:28.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}显然 我不能把迪丽斯库阿特 搬到泰晤士河上去
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.76,0:40:33.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But spending time with these ingenious Dutch farmers
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.76,0:40:33.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但和这些聪明的荷兰农民待在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.40,0:40:36.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}had convinced me that if we're going to survive,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.40,0:40:36.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}让我确信 如果我们想生存下去
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.04,0:40:41.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we absolutely had to modernise.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.04,0:40:41.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们必须彻底现代化
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.36,0:40:48.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（下集预告）
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.44,0:40:51.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is the remote-controlled toy you always wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.44,0:40:51.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是你一直想要的遥控玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.24,0:40:52.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.24,0:40:52.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.92,0:40:54.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.92,0:40:54.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.48,0:40:55.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.48,0:40:55.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们遇到麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.00,0:40:58.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Are they gonna stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.00,0:40:58.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们会留下来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.36,0:40:59.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.36,0:40:59.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.72,0:41:03.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Been a long time! I'm back, mate! - Alan!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.72,0:41:03.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好久不见！对 我回来了 老兄！ - 艾伦！你回来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.84,0:41:06.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You're back! - That's a bit of a man hug, ain't it!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.84,0:41:06.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这算是男人的拥抱 是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.44,0:41:36.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}字幕翻译： 匡思颖
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.52,0:41:38.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}创意监督 张珺怡
